function score(entry,qObj){const nq=qObj.phrase;if(!nq)return 0;const aliases=[entry.title,...entry.aliases].map(norm);let best=0;for(const a of aliases){if(a===nq)best=Math.max(best,110);else if(a.includes(nq)||nq.includes(a))best=Math.max(best,88);let hit=0;for(const t of qObj.tokens){if(a.includes(t))hit++;else{const aw=a.split(' ');if(aw.some(w=>editDistance(t,w,t.length>=8?2:1)<=1))hit+=.65}}if(qObj.tokens.length)best=Math.max(best,Math.round((hit/qObj.tokens.length)*72));}return best;}
